          "pl": "Kanał „kontekst osobisty”: najlepiej pasujące fragmenty dawnych rozmów i bieżąca rozmowa. Bez pamięci i grafu.",
          "en": "A “personal context” channel: the best matching passages of past conversations and the current conversation. Without memory and the graph."
        },
        "order": "stability",
        "sources": {
          "profile": false,
          "rules": false,
          "memory": false,
          "project": false,
          "history": true,
          "graph": false,
          "search": true,
          "kb": false
        },
        "breadth": {
          "nodes": 0,
          "search_limit": 10,
          "history_window": null
        },
        "depth": {
          "hops": 0
        },
        "representation": "raw",
        "flow": "plain",
        "budget_tokens": null,
        "status": "calibration",
        "note": {
          "pl": "Kalibracja: to nasze przybliżenie, nie odtworzenie; dokładne odtworzenie i testy porównawcze są w etapie replikacji. 10 wyników szukania to liczba presetu. Dziś jądro jeszcze nie stosuje tego profilu (dojdzie w pozycji K1); działa tylko porządek „stability”.",
          "en": "Calibration: this is our approximation, not a replica; the exact replication and comparative tests belong to the replication stage. 10 search results is a preset number. Today the kernel does not apply this profile yet (it comes with work item K1); only the order “stability” works."
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "value_schema": {
    "type": "object",
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "required": [
      "context_order",
      "orders"
    ],
    "properties": {
      "context_order": {
        "type": "string",
        "x-setting": "/context_order",
        "x-consumer": "chat_engine",
        "description": "Name of the active order; must be a key of orders. Per-send option context_order and config key chat_context_order override it. Preset: stability."
      },
      "orders": {
        "type": "object",
        "x-setting": "/orders",
        "x-consumer": "chat_engine",
        "additionalProperties": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "system",
              "profile",
              "rules",
              "memory",
              "project",
              "history",
              "graph"
            ]
          }
        },
        "description": "Named orders over the classes system (S0), profile (the stable part about the user), rules (the rules about the user), memory (S1), project (S2), history (S3), graph (S4). Active task and the question (S5) are always last."
      },
      "selector_profiles": {
        "type": "array",
        "x-setting": "/selector_profiles",
        "x-consumer": "chat_engine",
        "description": "Presets of the context selector, listed as the view kind selector_profiles (node selector_profile:<id>). A profile is a bundle of existing knobs; the kernel reads the table from work item M1-K1 on.",
        "items": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "id",
            "label",
            "order",
            "status"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "id": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "description": "Name of the profile; the address of its node is selector_profile:<id>."
            },
            "label": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "pl",
                "en"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "pl": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1
                },
                "en": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1
                }
              },
              "additionalProperties": false
            },
            "why": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "pl",
                "en"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "pl": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1
                },
                "en": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1
                }
              },
              "additionalProperties": false
            },
            "order": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "description": "A key of orders."
            },
            "sources": {
              "type": "object",
              "description": "Which classes of context the profile reads: profile, rules, memory, project, history, graph, search, kb. true = read (the conversation toggles still apply); false = not read.",
              "additionalProperties": {
                "type": "boolean"
              }
            },
            "breadth": {
              "type": "object",
              "description": "nodes: how many graph nodes (null = setting graph_memory_max_nodes); search_limit: how many search results; history_window: how many last messages (null = the whole conversation).",
              "properties": {
                "nodes": {
                  "type": [
                    "integer",
                    "null"
                  ]
                },
                "search_limit": {
                  "type": [
                    "integer",
                    "null"
                  ]
                },
                "history_window": {
                  "type": [
                    "integer",
                    "null"
                  ]
                }
              },
              "additionalProperties": false
            },
            "depth": {
              "type": "object",
              "description": "hops: how many links from the focus the graph selection follows (null = setting graph_memory_depth).",
              "properties": {
                "hops": {
                  "type": [
                    "integer",
                    "null"
                  ]
                }
              },
              "additionalProperties": false
            },
            "representation": {
              "type": [
                "string",
                "null"
              ],
              "description": "A preset of the guardian profile representation (raw, denoised, lean, guardian, mixed); null = setting chat_representation."
            },
            "flow": {
              "type": [
                "string",
                "null"
              ],
              "description": "A flow of the guardian profile context_io (plain, graph_out, graph_in, graph_io); null = setting chat_flow."
            },
            "budget_tokens": {
              "type": [
                "integer",
                "null"
              ],
              "description": "A token budget of the profile’s own; null = none of its own."
            },
            "status": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "description": "preset or calibration (a user’s own profile may use its own word)."
            },
            "note": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "pl",
                "en"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "pl": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1
                },
                "en": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1
                }
              },
              "additionalProperties": false
            }
          },
          "additionalProperties": true
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
